{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208330","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120833001:1":{"text":"…헉헉! 뭔 거미가 이렇게 많아. 중화제가 없었다면… 으으, 상상만으로도 소름 끼쳐요.","source_cn":"……呼！洞里的毒液诡蛛果然多，要是没有中和剂，不知道要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE0CE3DDBD18163A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120833002:1":{"text":"…거, 거미에게 물린 것 같군. 중화제가 있는가?","source_cn":"……我、我好像被咬伤了，你们谁有中和剂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8694818FE3AA7B4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120833003:1":{"text":"그러니까 왜 굳이 따라오겠다고… 자, 여기, 미리 말해두는데 이거 마지막 중화제야.","source_cn":"荒矛老爷，您看看，干嘛非要亲自跟来呢？这是最后的中和剂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB488313277AD2F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120833004:1":{"text":"네? 벌써 다 썼어요?! 전에 분명…","source_cn":"咦，已经用完了吗？！我们之前明明——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84DB882CFF6E27C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120833005:1":{"text":"…당연히 다 썼지! 나리, 좀 많이 필요할 것 같다고 얘기라도 하지 그랬어?","source_cn":"——用完了，当然用完了！毕竟之前老爷只让我们找了那么一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B3CE6F6A9EBD9A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120833006:1":{"text":"다 쉬었으면, 계속 길 안내하지 않겠어? 나도 궁금해졌거든. 어떤 보물이 묻혔길래, 석양의 눈 같은 보석을 현상금으로 내놨는지 말이야.","source_cn":"您休息好了，麻烦接着指路？阿德我还想看看埋在这里的珍宝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x644FFA01952E85C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:荒矛":{"text":"파이크","source":"荒矛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿德":{"text":"에디","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":4}}